126:**Pacing curve:** episode lengths do NOT monotonically shrink (7·14·18·7·8·13·13·20.9 s) — the Observe hypothesis of preparation-wide acceleration is **withdrawn** on this evidence. What accelerates is local: chop cadence inside S3/S6 and the S4 press episode's compression (0.86 beats/s, the film's peak). The sound track prices the same shape: near-silent gaps of 1.2–1.6 s separate early action sounds, while RMS accents cluster at the transformation moments (26.25 · 34–35.5 · 43.25 · 51.25 · 66–67 s). Scene-detection totals (31 @0.35 · 83 @0.20) are threshold-sensitive on stop-motion and are printed as candidate counts only; the true shot count is UNVERIFIED.
